        "subject": "=How did we do? [{{ $json.id }}]",
        "text": "=Hi {{ $json.customerName }},\n\nYour recent support request has been resolved. We'd love to hear your feedback!\n\nPlease take a moment to rate your experience:\n\n⭐ Very Satisfied: {{ $env.SURVEY_URL }}?ticket={{ $json.id }}&rating=5\n⭐ Satisfied: {{ $env.SURVEY_URL }}?ticket={{ $json.id }}&rating=4\n⭐ Neutral: {{ $env.SURVEY_URL }}?ticket={{ $json.id }}&rating=3\n⭐ Dissatisfied: {{ $env.SURVEY_URL }}?ticket={{ $json.id }}&rating=2\n⭐ Very Dissatisfied: {{ $env.SURVEY_URL }}?ticket={{ $json.id }}&rating=1\n\nYour feedback helps us improve!\n\nBest regards,\nSupport Team"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
